#: f3e18ad8224f45b2bfcad22258a955dd
msgid ""
"Each piece of content is of a kind that not only has one particular job to "
"do, that job is also clearly distinguished from and contrasted with the "
"other functions of documentation."
msgstr ""

#: 866d4e9b82e34ca0aaa4a14b46ac4508
msgid "Blur"
msgstr ""

#: 6895fcd5a18446358a5576d89040aacb
msgid ""
"Most documentation systems and authors recognise at least some of these "
"distinctions and try to observe them in practice."
msgstr ""

#: 2bd7f36820094492a2ee75e9e8c3a6a4
msgid "Partial collapse of the structure"
msgstr ""

#: a61076fa21cb4d808b79c7d198718697
msgid ""
"However, there is a kind of natural affinity between each of the different "
"forms of documentation and its neighbours on the map, and a natural tendency"
" to blur the distinctions (that can be seen repeatedly in examples of "
"documentation)."
msgstr ""

#: b1721eb1261c42549122146f8d206f86
msgid "guide action"
msgstr ""

#: 3643f7b82b764b6e936a1dcaad491c94 9feb47c509124959a4b54ec43efffa71
msgid "tutorials"
msgstr ""

#: 85e31d6eedab45128109e2d659674afe 2491404990d9453599f0a035ff21783f
msgid "how-to guides"
msgstr ""

#: 5dc1849219c74e06a7e9fd8d7ffdafc9
msgid "serve the application of skill"
msgstr ""

#: 514ab503bff345e188bd0203ec232e79 3c0e95d647b4419d8fdb1df13de8a0ad
msgid "reference"
msgstr ""

#: 90f995cd3abc4ed895e51f870004aa16
msgid "contain propositional knowledge"
msgstr ""

#: 8dfc10f2b76641b0be4626b85eb801ce 1a1166ed5e5b418d9fee5ac3f1a1fcbf
msgid "explanation"
msgstr ""

#: e622e51eb8e646a581d25de5d22b432c
msgid "serve the acquisition of skill"
msgstr ""

#: e2eefa51813d43e68ab050601faf64ab
msgid ""
"When these distinctions are allowed to blur, the different kinds of "
"documentation bleed into each other. Writing style and content make their "
"way into inappropriate places. It also causes structural problems, which "
"make it even more difficult to maintain the discipline of appropriate "
"writing."
msgstr ""

#: 057310ea32f24c1ab69a51a855fed18a
msgid "Total collapse of the structure"
msgstr ""

#: 6772e7baee20432aa7c8eab75785efd9
msgid ""
"In the worst case there is a complete or partial collapse of tutorials and "
"how-to guides into each other, making it impossible to meet the needs served"
" by either."
msgstr ""

#: ec608a08e91741b2b4bd207d14e2fd04
msgid "The journey around the map"
msgstr ""

#: abd3eb6d51014a80abf8b99375f6c006
msgid ""
"Diátaxis is intended to help documentation better serve users in their "
"*cycle of interaction* with a product."
msgstr ""

#: 1fe452b339e64c13b75562d9d707390d
msgid ""
"This phrase should not be understood too literally. It is not the case that "
"a user must encounter the different kinds of documentation in the order "
"*tutorials* > *how-to guides* > *technical reference* > *explanation*. In "
"practice, an actual user may enter the documentation anywhere in search of "
"guidance on some particular subject, and what they want to read will change "
"from moment to moment as they use your documentation."
msgstr ""

#: 7c5bc522800d479abf18fc2427836aa4
msgid ""
"However, the idea of a cycle of documentation needs, that proceeds through "
"different phases, is sound and corresponds to the way that people actually "
"do become expert in a craft. There is a sense and meaning to this ordering."
msgstr ""

#: e2e30e6b288e4132bbc376411fbcf218
msgid "Moving around the map"
msgstr ""

#: 4f72f3d4917944c7ae8485db979a2fc6
msgid ""
"*learning-oriented phase*: We begin by learning, and learning a skill means "
"diving straight in to do it - under the guidance of a teacher, if we're "
"lucky."
msgstr ""

#: 73a0fb46db1e4d57949df72e2f2baaa1
msgid "*goal-oriented phase*: Next we want to put the skill to work."
msgstr ""

#: 8216318496a24ed0b889dd6d30bbf7c3
msgid ""
"*information-oriented phase*: As soon as our work calls upon knowledge that "
"we don't already have in our head, it requires us to consult technical "
"reference."
msgstr ""

#: fb27415f46954be5813c722ef549361e
msgid ""
"*explanation-oriented phase*: Finally, away from the work, we reflect on our"
" practice and knowledge to understand the whole."
msgstr ""

#: fceb2e407be14a17ac178acbd72e770e
msgid ""
"And then it's back to the beginning, perhaps for a new thing to grasp, or to"
" penetrate deeper."
msgstr ""
